### HTTP Request

### REGISTRAR NUEVO USUARIO 
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "ulises_usuario",
    "email": "ulises_usuario@correo.com",
    "password": "mi-clave-segura",
    "role": "user"
}


### USUARIO ADMIN

POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "ulises_admin",
    "email": "ulises_admin@correo.com",
    "password": "mi-clave-segura",
    "role": "admin"
}

### Login usuario sin permisos de administrador
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ulises_user",
  "password": "mi-clave-segura"
}

### Login usuario con permisos de administrador
# @name login
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ulises_admin",
  "password": "mi-clave-segura"
}

### VER LISTA DE USUARIOS (Usa el token dinámico del paso anterior para la autorización)
GET http://localhost:3000/users
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.authorizationToken}}

###
PATCH http://localhost:3000/users/ulises_NO_user
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "ulises_NO_user",
    "email": "ulises_NO_user_EDITADO@correo.com"
}

###
DELETE http://localhost:3000/users/ulises_NO_user




### CREAR TURNO
POST http://localhost:3000/appointments
Content-Type: application/json

{ 
    "clientName": "Luciano",
    "clientEmail": "lucianoApp@correo.com",
    "date": "2026-10-10T19:30:00.000Z", 
    "service": "Barba"
}

### VER TODOS LOS TURNOS
GET http://localhost:3000/appointments

### CAMBIAR ESTADO DE UN TURNO
PATCH http://localhost:3000/appointments/6a471c49816cae1748a8a3cd/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "confirmed"
}

### BORRAR UN TURNO
DELETE http://localhost:3000/appointments/6a471c49816cae1748a8a3cd



